// Surface sweep, surface loft and solid loft. The path, the sections and the guides are sketch wires, 2D or 3D
// (3D sketch: buildSketch3D). Naming (core/NAMING.md):
//   - sweep: face generated by the curve C of the path and the curve P of the profile, "<id>/side(C|P)";
//   - loft: face generated by the curve C of the first section, "<id>/side(C)", or "<id>/side(C.k)" when it is split
//     into several faces (span k between two sections, ruled loft);
//   - free edges at both ends, through a virtual end face: "e(<id>/side(…)|<id>/start)" and "e(<id>/end|<id>/side(…))";
//   - end faces of a solid loft: "<id>/start" and "<id>/end";
//   - faces left without a name (unexpected case): "<id>/side(#k)", by rank.
